  {
   "id": "romeo-is-a-dead-man-347119@major-2026-06-25",
   "gameId": "romeo-is-a-dead-man-347119",
   "displayName": "Announcement of “ROMEO'S UPDATED, MAN” Content Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-06-25T17:01:20.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Ver.1.5.000 update includes a special Hotline Miami collaboration. The newly added features",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "are as follows",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "##",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Costume Change feature added",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Upon clearing the game and saving game data, Romeo becomes able to change",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "costumes in his room on the Space-Time Ship.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Romeo’s new costumes can be seen in playable parts of the game as well as some",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "cutscenes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "-New costumes added",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "By using the above-mentioned Costume Change feature, Romeo can change into",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "costumes based on the “Jacket” and “Biker” characters from Hotline Miami.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45743258/27c9dba0eeaa568a902b25740784253fb473a03f.png\"][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45743258/569883525a4df6e7e0c3ab68a68324ad6440528f.png\"]There is a total of ten selectable costumes, including the two Hotline Miami outfits.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Additionally, Romeo can also toggle between his three different masks (his initial",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "mask, later mask, and inner mask).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "-Photo Mode feature added",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "A new “Photo Mode” – accessible from the pause menu – has also been added.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "This feature allows players to take screenshots during the 3D parts of the game.[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45743258/022954176d07ab4b12dd0bbf99134ec086ea1b88.jpg\"]Players can utilize adjustments to camera angle, color correction, depth of field, and",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "frame art.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "We hope you continue to enjoy and support Romeo Is A Dead Man.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
