  {
   "id": "romeo-is-a-dead-man-347119@1.4.000",
   "gameId": "romeo-is-a-dead-man-347119",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.4.000",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-02-20T07:00:40.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Today we've released the latest update patch (Ver.1.4.000) for Romeo Is A Dead Man.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "The following issues have been fixed in this update",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug where, upon dying during the Chapter 4 boss battle, if the most recent Save Data was in \"Subspace\", the character would fall infinitely, causing the game to become unplayable.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "*If you have already saved while this issue was occurring, allowing Romeo to fall to his death once will restore the game to its normal state.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue causing the rendering frame rate to drop significantly under specific conditions with DLSS enabled.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue preventing language settings from being applied correctly under specific conditions.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Removed the \"Upsampling Quality\" option from the Graphics Settings menu.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "The \"Graphics Quality\" option in the Graphics Settings menu has been moved to just below the \"Upsampling Method\" option.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "FSR3, DLSS, and XeSS quality are now affected by the \"Graphics Quality\" setting.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "The quality settings for FSR3, DLSS, and XeSS previously offered three levels: Performance, Balance, and Quality. However, since linking them to the \"Graphics Quality\" setting, they now cover five levels: Low, Medium, High, Very High, and Ultra High.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "*When set to Ultra High, the internal resolution of each upsampler becomes equivalent to 100%, functioning as an anti-aliasing feature.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "We sincerely apologize for any inconvenience the above-listed bugs may have caused our players.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "We truly appreciate your continued support of Romeo Is A Dead Man.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45743258/528787cd7f91221b7bd31710372bc94364e02daf.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
